#
# BOTH TAKE AN IDENTITY TABLE, and for `V51` that is the whole point of the rule rather than a
# default. The `C-45` debt this rev exists to make countable reached FOUR consecutive batches
# at zero, and the sentence that let it is *"at least three portable lessons exist and are
# unwritten"* -- prose that NAMES the debt while naming no count and no ids. Under a
# contains-test that cell scores DECLARED; under `_V51_VERDICTS` it is `unidentified`, and the
# finding says which answers count. `V45`'s count limb, re-applied: asking for a NUMBER alone
