    # ================== rev82. THE PUBLISHED FLOW NAMES NOBODY =============================
    #
    # The operator ruled on 2026-09-16 that the published flow carry no direct or indirect
    # reference to its origin project, and on 2026-09-18 -- measuring the result on a fresh
    # clone -- extended it to the OPERATOR and revoked rev81's carve-out for the detector's
    # own vocabulary. (Both rulings are quoted verbatim in the authoring repository's revision
