    # the mirror repository). A hand list would be `C-50`'s second inventory, and the file it
    # would have forgotten is the one that mattered most: the validator's own prose, which
    # SHIPS in `scripts/` and held 79 of the 172 direct mentions at rev80 and 21 of the 28
